        {
          "text": "Station #2."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Key Takeaways about:",
          "bold": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bulleted-list",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "bold": true,
              "text": "Known Acquaintances:"
            },
            {
              "text": " The mystery figure associated with Cersei, Jaime, and Joffrey. They mentioned Cersei frequently, and Jaime always as an auxiliary figure. Names only came up semi frequently."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Locations: ",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Kings"
            },
            {
              "bold": true,
              "text": " "
            },
            {
              "text": "Landing. Private room."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Professions: ",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Sword fighting was mentioned frequently by multiple archival items. Also mentioned was writing, reading, and drawing. Thus, we believe the mystery individual was a sword fighter or at least studied sword fighting. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Health Info: ",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Mystery individual mentioned a leg that was frequently bothering them and seemed older in their age range."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Personal Info: ",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": "Loved mutton and drinking. Mentioned reading frequently and seemed to often have conflicts. Never wanted to go north of the wall."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Group Choice Label -- Favorite Phrases: ",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": "\"You know nothing.\""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "\nWhat this suggests about their:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bulleted-list",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Relationships: ",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "Relationships seemed very tight, whether they were personal or professional. Acquaintances frequently disclosed personal information to the mystery individual, suggesting that they enjoyed intimate, trusting relationships across all realms of life."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Lifestyle: ",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "Individual was very active, constantly traveling. Enjoyed drinking and sword fighting, though that seemed to be common at the time. No reference to a wife or husband or any romantic partner. "
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Public Persona: ",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "Publicly, we only know this individual through their work -- but their work included both nonfiction and fiction writings that were related in content. Thus, the individual seemed very knowledgeable and made themselves an expert on the topic, both in fiction and nonfiction."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Private Identity: ",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "Privately, the individual seemed very prickly. They frequently used colorful language and expressed irritation, though were always interested in helping others around them."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Complications in Evidence: ",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": "We struggled to delineate between private and public persona because it was difficult to know what was shared and what was not. Thus, we may have interpreted some of the archival materials incorrectly or relied on assumptions. "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Based on the available evidence, the individual appears to be…..",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": "a Lord Commander of the Night's Watch. Male, mid-20's. We based this hypothesis mainly on the evidence regarding their professional interests as it helped form an anchor with which to interpret the rest of the evidence.\n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "Researchers might study this individual because…",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": "this is the youngest Lord Commander in history. Thus, their achievements -- especially during such a tumultuous time -- are significant within their field."
        }
      ]
    },
